  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_01",
      "hash64": "4DD04D4773929EBA",
      "text": "今天有什么事吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_select_01",
      "hash64": "B1EB6702BB84D9F7",
      "text": "参加蓝莓联盟！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_select_02",
      "hash64": "B1EB6802BB84DBAA",
      "text": "什么事也没有……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_02",
      "hash64": "4DD04C4773929D07",
      "text": "很抱歉，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你正在留学，\\n似乎不是蓝莓学园\\r\\n正式的学生……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "556F26944351BF5A",
      "text": "啊～没关系，没关系！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "556F25944351BDA7",
      "text": "刚才四天王已经\\n三下五除二地决定了！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_03",
      "hash64": "4DD04B4773929B54",
      "text": "杜若你说的话，\\n可信度有点……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_brother_01",
      "hash64": "DDAF5C5FD7DF32C3",
      "text": "杜若说的没错。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_brother_02",
      "hash64": "DDAF5D5FD7DF3476",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]报名参加蓝莓联盟\\n这事我同意了。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_04",
      "hash64": "4DD04A47739299A1",
      "text": "既然冠军都这么说了！\\n那就请稍等一下吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "556F24944351BBF4",
      "text": "你帮大忙了～真没想到啊。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_brother_03",
      "hash64": "DDAF5E5FD7DF3629",
      "text": "……你好像在背地里\\n偷偷操控着什么。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_brother_04",
      "hash64": "DDAF5F5FD7DF37DC",
      "text": "不过，能和[VAR 0x0100(0000)]对战，\\n对我来说也是求之不得。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "556F23944351BA41",
      "text": "嘿嘿嘿，\\n那太好了。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_brother_05",
      "hash64": "DDAF605FD7DF398F",
      "text": "……[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_brother_06",
      "hash64": "DDAF615FD7DF3B42",
      "text": "我不允许你在\\n和我对战之前输掉。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_select_03",
      "hash64": "B1EB6902BB84DD5D",
      "text": "我会加油的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_select_04",
      "hash64": "B1EB6202BB84D178",
      "text": "我才不会输！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_brother_07",
      "hash64": "DDAF625FD7DF3CF5",
      "text": "……那就好。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_brother_08",
      "hash64": "DDAF635FD7DF3EA8",
      "text": "我会在巅峰对决时，\\n让你看到我和过去有多不一样。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_sister_01",
      "hash64": "EFBFD84C5DEE9A37",
      "text": "阿栗！你怎么和[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n那样说话……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_brother_09",
      "hash64": "DDAF645FD7DF405B",
      "text": "姐姐，你闭嘴。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_brother_10",
      "hash64": "DDB2615FD7E17119",
      "text": "我很期待\\n你一路赢下去。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_sister_02",
      "hash64": "EFBFD94C5DEE9BEA",
      "text": "…………[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_sister_03",
      "hash64": "EFBFDA4C5DEE9D9D",
      "text": "抱歉，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n阿栗他让你很不舒服吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_sister_04",
      "hash64": "EFBFD34C5DEE91B8",
      "text": "我也是隔了好久才和他说话，\\n真～是让人不爽……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "556F22944351B88E",
      "text": "人家贵为冠军，\\n当然牛得不得了咯～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_sister_05",
      "hash64": "EFBFD44C5DEE936B",
      "text": "杜若！你硬让[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n参加蓝莓联盟了，对吧！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "556F21944351B6DB",
      "text": "没有没有，\\n这可是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她本人自愿的呀。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_07",
      "hash64": "556F20944351B528",
      "text": "对吧～[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！？[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_08",
      "hash64": "556F1F944351B375",
      "text": "你看，多棒的回答！\\n人既然活在这世上呀～\\r\\n当然想做点惊天动地的事情啦！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_09",
      "hash64": "556F1E944351B1C2",
      "text": "极力否认就是承认！你看！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她本人也干劲十足哦～？[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_sister_06",
      "hash64": "EFBFD54C5DEE951E",
      "text": "总～觉得很可疑……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_sister_07",
      "hash64": "EFBFD64C5DEE96D1",
      "text": "……既然要参加，那就加油吧。\\n我也会为你加油的。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_sister_08",
      "hash64": "EFBFCF4C5DEE8AEC",
      "text": "阿栗……就拜托你了。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_05",
      "hash64": "4DD04947739297EE",
      "text": "久等了！\\n报名手续办完了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_10",
      "hash64": "556BA194434EA784",
      "text": "哦～完得正是时候。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
