    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_07",
      "hash64": "4DD0474773929488",
      "text": "挑战者通常是先和一般学生对战，\\n然后一路赢下去。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_08",
      "hash64": "4DD04647739292D5",
      "text": "但[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你有几位四天王\\n和席蓝校长的推荐，\\r\\n所以就从高排名开始吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_09",
      "hash64": "4DD0454773929122",
      "text": "你从一开始就能挑战\\n以生态巨蛋的４个区\\r\\n为据点的四天王。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_10",
      "hash64": "4DCCC847738F86E4",
      "text": "我帮你把位置\\n添加到手机洛托姆吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_11",
      "hash64": "4DCCC947738F8897",
      "text": "挑战四天王需要\\n通过[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]蓝乐活[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]获得的[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]ＢＰ[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！\\c\\n战胜所有的四天王，\\n就能挑战冠军哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
