    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_12",
      "hash64": "4DCCCA47738F8A4A",
      "text": "那么，在蓝莓联盟\\n好好加油吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_11",
      "hash64": "556BA294434EA937",
      "text": "你可以自由决定\\n从谁开始挑战。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
